  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass08B8FC532F87419DBEF2C89CDB80A978\"><p></p><div>A new report by Professor Pradines looking at the archaeological excavations determining the chronology of the coral stone mosques of the Maldives is now <a href=\"https&#58;//maxvanberchem.org/en/scientific-activities/projects/archeology/11-archeologie/171-archaeological-investigations-on-the-coral-stone-mosques-of-the-maldives\">online\u200b</a>.</div><div><br>\u200b</div></div>",
